{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eH4d-icEX3Fdlzj-GlsYsA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:10.506044+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eH4d-icEX3Fdlzj-GlsYsA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span>点击蓝字</span></p></section></section><section><p><span>关注我们</span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VlBk7y67hasuODNKK71LADNeWgic7WPLw6dUTbwLLo0e8QBogX7eJYpM5RNe8z4XdbwpibNr7KacAOQDepic1dAQQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=13&amp;tp=wxpic\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>院系简介</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>华中科技大学管理学院作为国内一流、国际知名的商学院，拥有一支深谙世界先进管理理念、熟悉中国企业发展经验的优秀师资队伍，工商管理学科评估获A-（全国前10%），在2021年软科世界一流学科排名中获内地高校排名第1。学院揽获AACSB、EQUIS、AMBA三大权威国际认证，跻身全球“三冠认证”商学院之列。</span></span></p><p><span><span>华中科技大学会计硕士专业学位研究生（简称MPAcc）教育聚焦数智时代发展需求，致力于培养掌握会计财务领域专业知识与实务、具备会计信息与新数字技术融合处理能力、熟悉国际管理和资本市场规则、具有全球战略眼光、创新精神和职业品德的国际化高层次复合型会计管理人才和会计财务领导者。历经多年建设发展，MPAcc项目已形成鲜明的“国际化”、“实务化”、“数智化”办学特色，创新构建“业财融合”人才培养体系，实现专业能力与业务场景的深度耦合，在国务院学位办专项合格评估中获优。MPAcc项目设置了会计（含会计理论与实务、财务管理理论与实务、成本理论与实务、ACCA）、大数据与商业分析、审计、税务、公司金融、供应链金融特色方向，为学生提供了多元化的发展路径，先后荣获全国MPAcc案例大赛一等奖、全国IMA案例大赛一等奖、湖北省MPAcc案例大赛特等奖，多名毕业生入选国家级、省级高端会计人才、领军人才。</span></span></p><p><span><span>为促进全国各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，增进其他高校优秀大学生对华中科技大学会计硕士项目的了解，学院拟举办2025年会计硕士全国优秀大学生夏令营。欢迎本科就读高校为具有免试研究生推荐资格的国内原“985”、原“211”大学相关专业优秀学生报名参加。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20220713090553.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VlBk7y67hatfqibezI5C5h3t9PoKWlTJYtqtfTvE7doNTxDAz8zibUd91ria0IkkcLLPu6zKUxMibSsO8icAStSb2Ag/640\" title=\"微信图片_20220713090553.jpg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>专业代码</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业名称</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>研究方向（限选</span></span><span><span>1个）</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>25300</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>会计</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>01 (全日制) 会计（含会计理论与实务、财务管理理论与实务、成本理论与实务、ACCA）</span></span></p><p><span><span>02 </span></span><span><span>(全日制)大数据与商业分析 </span></span></p><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span> (全日制) 审计</span></span></p><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span> (全日制) 税务</span></span></p><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span> (全日制) </span></span><span><span>公司金融</span></span></p><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span> (全日制) 供应链金融</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（须同时满足下列条件）</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>1、国内原“985”、原“211”大学会计、财务管理、审计、财政学、经济学、金融学、资产评估、金融工程、信息技术与管理、供应链金融、管理科学与工程、自动化、控制、数学、计算机等相关专业本科三年级在校生（2026届毕业生）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、本科前三年加权成绩在该校同年级专业前15%之内（院系教务部门出具证明并盖章）；若尚无第六学期成绩，可按前五学期成绩排名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、英语水平良好，达到以下至少任何一项要求：六级≥425分；托福≥90分；雅思≥6.5分。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。诚实守信，学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪、受处分（处罚）记录。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>申请人在规定时间内登录华中科技大学研究生招生系统报名（网址：http://yanzhao.hust.edu.cn/，点击学术夏令营进入），申请时间：即日起至6月22日24点，网上申请操作步骤可登录华中科技大学研究生招生信息网查看。</span></span></p><p><span><span>网上申请须上传报名材料外，还需上传：近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小30K以内；身份证正面整体照，电子版JPG格式，450×300像素，大小100K以内。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>报名材料要求</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（均为PDF格式）</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>1、申请表1份（务必注明申请方向，系统报名后自动生成）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、个人自述材料1份（见附件，网上申请时上传至“学术成果申请表及推荐信”文件夹）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、本科成绩单及专业排名证明1份（排名证明见附件，院系教务部门盖章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、英语六级考试成绩或托福/雅思成绩1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5、获奖证书，参与科研项目/实习实践证明各1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6、申请人还可提交已发表的论文、出版物或原创性工作成果。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人须确保报名材料真实无误，若后期经核查申请材料不属实，将取消营员资格。</span></span></p><p><span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料审核及选拔</span></strong></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>学院将组织专家对申请者材料进行审核。材料审核工作结束后，入营名单将在在管理学院MPAcc教育中心网站公布，网址：http://cm.hust.edu.cn/old/MPAcc/s_y.htm。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>营员待遇及要求</span></strong></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>1、夏令营活动结束后，营员将获得华中科技大学管理学院颁发的“华中科技大学会计硕士夏令营营员”证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、夏令营期间营员食宿由我院统一提供。被我院正式录取的武汉市外营员，2026年入学后按普通列车硬卧及以下、动车/高铁二等座标准报销夏令营往返交通费（需提供闭环原始票据和付款凭证，如不能直达需中转，中转时间不得超过24小时）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、夏令营实行统一管理，营员必须遵守学校管理规定，入营后未经批准不得擅自离校。营员在营期间需遵守纪律，在规定时间内办理入营及离营手续，全程参加夏令营各项活动。中途退出者不能获得营员证书，违反纪律者将通报营员所在学校。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、营员在营期间应注意人身安全，妥善保管随身财物。夏令营活动期间由于营员擅自活动而造成的人员和财产损失由本人负责。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>序号</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>事项</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>24点</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>夏令营申请截止</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>公布入营名单</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>3-4</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>夏令营活动</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>含</span></span><span><span>校园</span></span><span><span>参观</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>专业介绍、特色展示、</span></span><span><span>学术讲座、</span></span><span><span>师生交流等）</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>信息公开</span></b></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3ghAYicvqmLhibic1bYIV1mOf4z8hqzE4ibIGBKpiaKulDIHvf63vDoKQPWQg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>申请入营同学请以姓名+学校实名申请加入华中科技大学MPAcc夏令营QQ群（群号810235608），QQ群二维码如下：</span></span></p><p><span></span></p><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3gWH5TGOk7zV7X5TzQ9OWLDJrge6H22bb2Mpowl1BXh3uBO0X8G26tvg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>华中科技大学管理学院MPAcc&amp;MEM教育中心联系方式如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地址：湖北省武汉市洪山区珞喻路</span></span><span>1037号管理学院236</span><span><span>室</span></span><span>  官方电话：027-87541911   </span></span></p><p><span><span>官方邮箱:kcxglxy@mail.hust.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>官方微信：华中科技大学MPAcc</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VlBk7y67hasb0NE05DFKLu2JviakT7O3g6pLN2pcAiaWN5Oalic6JN0Xic3fEeRPiahBjRcJaYQlsVMediaAhaBdGI1Q/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VlBk7y67has9UAMaSSZEkKmY2l59mzlj2S6yTFqzPJTCNccGNUfg8qr4BaTUTr3icFkadmJG6pd1sYUsb3wJPbw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ee92002e89ec9f128cee9215e2ff0478efc8f2441d85694130bf4ee9fb3a0242","textLength":2249,"sourceSha256":"3f9337609066b66ceddc2205236ec9993340af499b770389013a1f6141f9c56b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-003f14ba08ddeaa41d39","title":"2025年华中科技大学管理学院2025年“全国优秀大学生 暑期夏令营”（会计硕士）招募启事","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:10.506044+00:00"}
